@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. GET / -> 200 OK (Kiem tra dich vu)
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. POST hop le -> 201 Created + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200413",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/test/bai3"
}

### 4. GET luot nop vua tao -> 200 OK (received -> processing -> graded)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thieu du lieu -> 400 Bad Request (INVALID_REQUEST)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST bai 99 khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found (ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200413",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/test/bai3"
}

### 7. GET id rong / khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found (SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR -> 200 OK + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1